   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Functions <span data-math=\"a, b, c, d, e\">a, b, c, d, e</span>, and <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> are given below. Which functions are linear? <strong>Select the three</strong> answers that apply.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"a(x)=3x\">a(x)=3x</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"b(x)=3^x\">b(x)=3^x</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"c(x)=x^3\">c(x)=x^3</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"d(x)=9+3x\">d(x)=9+3x</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"e(x)=9 \\cdot 3^x\">e(x)=9 \\cdot 3^x</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=9 \\cdot 3x\">f(x)=9 \\cdot 3x</span></li>\n</ol>",
